# Project Frontier Specific
# NOTE: We are NOT ignoring Assets/Meshes, Assets/Prefabs, or Assets/Textures anymore.
# These are generated by the pipeline but should be tracked to ensure the project 
# runs out-of-the-box without requiring a rebuild immediately after cloning.
# If you strictly want to ignore them to save space, uncomment the lines below:
# Assets/Meshes/
# Assets/Prefabs/Generated/
# Assets/Textures/Generated/
# Assets/Audio/Generated/

